{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "976da072965738f619ee9f9e054eb5f7096a87d6386ab2c06ad8bdd66d2f6f26", "ja": "期待と不安と", "zh": "期待与不安", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "d000aaf70360f86535019e38ee9d7daa2a0bc2d5527f22e6db680a5f9820274c", "ja": "劇場の代表として、多くの事務所が参加する\n『合同ライブ』に出演する事になった、\n未来、静香、翼。まずは事前に開催される\n『PRライブ』に向けて、3人は気合いを\n入れるのだった。", "zh": "作为剧场的代表，未来、静香和翼将参加众多事务所共同参与的“联合演唱会”。首先，为了即将举办的“宣传演唱会”，3人打起了精神。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "20077a389a0742dd01d5015acc49caa3e309f8f563f5941d792990885859951c", "ja": "（未来も静香も翼も、今日は劇場にいるみたいだな。\n早速、合同ライブの話をしてみよう！）", "zh": "（未来、静香和翼今天好像都在剧场。赶紧去和她们聊聊联合演出的事吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_01_1001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "f5d57705f280c5e671161fd6891f5008060b030048c4ad92dd33787aaf33dad2", "ja": "未来、静香ちゃん、知ってる？\n今度おっきなライブがあるんだって～！", "zh": "未来、静香，你们知道吗？\n听说下次有场大型演唱会哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_01_1002_014mir", "source_sha256": "d121e256c4e590ac10c0d05397ac0b4cc7a8430ac731039b388d5ae5d9b607bc", "ja": "おっきなライブ？　へえ～、そんなのがあるんだ！\nねえねえ、静香ちゃんは知ってた？", "zh": "大型演唱会？嘿——还有这种活动啊！\n对了对了，静香，你知道吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_01_1003_015siz", "source_sha256": "6f33ffe9a9705431464b346b16ddf269e3221a628372848dd0509d27d3e40cb7", "ja": "ううん。私は聞いたことないけど……。\nねえ、翼。その話、誰に教えてもらったの？", "zh": "嗯，我没听说过……  \n对了，翼，这件事是谁告诉你的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_01_1004_016tsu", "source_sha256": "77dc9856765d8b98e3752370641b6abf20757140865d9436c0f5be3c236b5701", "ja": "美咲さんだよ。すっごく楽しそうにしてたから、\n何か良いことでもあったのかなーって。", "zh": "是美咲小姐哦。因为她看起来特别开心，所以我就在想，是不是遇到什么好事了呢——。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_01_1005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "65e9336f4d0d3506561705288b45d7d6f05e8847fe150791cc064a9ea4528176", "ja": "理由を聞いたら、おっきなライブに向けて、\nすっごい横断幕を作るんだって！", "zh": "我问了原因后，她说要为大型演唱会制作一幅超棒的横幅！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_01_1006_015siz", "source_sha256": "81b6b6521c8fcf0f75e8adf0936552c0ba34e50b11aaca527eb13f4de4a327b9", "ja": "すっごい横断幕……？　どんな……？", "zh": "好厉害的横幅……？是什么样的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_01_1007_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_01_1008_p", "source_sha256": "9aa5fdb47feb6c08c80807089405b00e6ab3d9961544e1604cc0199c40a9aba6", "ja": "みんな、お疲れ様。\n未来、静香、翼……ちょっと話があるんだ！", "zh": "大家辛苦了。\n未来、静香、翼……我有点事想和你们谈谈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_01_1009_014mir", "source_sha256": "d09b15e86f1352bfb1f816872a9e84b677fbe186bce4ca34c7971c2f39282670", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！\nおっきなライブがあるって、本当ですか？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n听说要举办大型演唱会，是真的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_01_1010_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d6b0447738fbcce734487eca799e9a520fa433d2e81cb7654d373c8db76df62c", "ja": "あ、未来ってばズルい～！\nわたしが聞こうと思ったのにー！", "zh": "啊，未来真狡猾～！\n我本来想问的嘛——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_01_1011_p", "source_sha256": "953e80371e2db2ed22fbf2847fe54cbe636244e7d8475eb262b3a7bb3b642a72", "ja": "あれ？　どうしてその話を知ってるんだ？", "zh": "咦？你怎么知道这事的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_01_1012_014mir", "source_sha256": "e5bca2b3c8fef43e1f6a15de1d35dabe13a2586ef9a965248776f11e4239bba2", "ja": "ってことは、ほんとなんですか～！　わあ～！\nおっきなライブって、どんな感じなんだろう～。", "zh": "这么说，是真的咯～！哇～！\n大型演唱会究竟会是什么感觉呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_01_1013_015siz", "source_sha256": "86d0e2409b639117d6e21f6f657b0191a3a28e8e369f97a7e189112415c558f0", "ja": "あの、{$P$}、私達に話っていうのは\nもしかして……、そのライブのことですか？", "zh": "那个，{$P$}，您要跟我们说的事，\n难不成……就是关于那场演唱会吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_01_1014_p", "source_sha256": "a9bac87b622fbf6f048baa7cc63b7313ecbc80bf8d63e79838da09559660f32a", "ja": "そうなんだ。今度、色々な事務所のアイドルが参加する\n合同ライブが開催されることになったんだけど……。", "zh": "是这样的。下次要举办一场由各个事务所的偶像参加的联合演唱会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_01_1015_p", "source_sha256": "1f9c0c2bc915efa13f233f7c7b578a4032f33a1cebe810c9c9d6753337aa18a0", "ja": "3人には、合同ライブとその前に行われるPRライブに\n参加してもらいたい。劇場の代表としてな！", "zh": "想让你们3个人去参加联合演唱会，\n以及在此之前举办的宣发演出。作为剧场的代表！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_01_1016_014mir", "source_sha256": "3022386b1965bae079990f541f4c937dba5acc5788fcd0845e09890d6ec18ab6", "ja": "わあーっ、楽しそう！\nはいはーい、もちろん参加しまーすっ！", "zh": "哇——感觉好有意思！\n好——的，我当然要参加啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_01_1017_016tsu", "source_sha256": "fea7b58da63c8c7eeaf66201d4e1df62e29a00d7bbe7301a13159d830b04db5e", "ja": "わたしも！　他の事務所のアイドルもいるんですよね？\n楽しみ～♪", "zh": "我也要去！　还有其他事务所的偶像对吧？\n好期待呀～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_01_1018_015siz", "source_sha256": "42b57710934597c7333c28dd3b9ddd0516c224b07db4baf39e91d0f7833f347b", "ja": "劇場の、代表……。", "zh": "剧场的代表……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_01_1019_p", "source_sha256": "643df5fde437672fcad81dee56b35187feb7de7f6d7509c706c6cedf6df65b50", "ja": "どうした、静香？", "zh": "怎么了，静香？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_01_1020_015siz", "source_sha256": "af00b7e4e48da9572dd5837547c1e6ac66004b9b5b102d988d00892acc573956", "ja": "あっ、い、いえ、何でもありません！\nせっかくのチャンスですし、絶対にやりたいです！", "zh": "啊，没、没什么！  \n难得有这样的机会，我绝对想参加！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_01_1021_p", "source_sha256": "46d969d12fed9f6d2162286bad2b03b2f261f8c54b595b050d2ab23343c936a3", "ja": "そう言ってくれてよかった。それで……参加する\nアイドル達が全員で歌う、共通曲があるんだ。", "zh": "这样说我就放心了。然后……有一首由所有参加活动的偶像共同演唱的歌曲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_01_1022_p", "source_sha256": "ebc2fadbe7b603b8dd1f56bc933e03bf551d29afdae0384767c7ad8505605293", "ja": "『なんどでも笑おう』って曲なんだけど。\nとりあえず、聞いてみてくれ。", "zh": "叫作《无论多少次都要欢笑》。\n你先听听看吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_01_1024_014mir", "source_sha256": "3d9cb95a14ba214d068ff1109c5c413b385bdb366b29f64e005786db1121da5a", "ja": "わあ～！　なんか素敵な曲ですねっ。\n聞いてるだけで元気になってくる気がします♪", "zh": "哇～！感觉是一首很棒的歌呢。\n光是听着就觉得浑身充满活力了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_01_1025_015siz", "source_sha256": "d39eb2a5351cbcead9c36d4dcd9b63ecff5e9d90a4ceac98435486bd5b643afe", "ja": "うん。優しいリズムが心地いいわね。\n心にすっと馴染むような曲……。", "zh": "嗯，温柔的节奏听起来很舒服。\n是那种仿佛能让人内心渐渐接受的曲子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_01_1026_014mir", "source_sha256": "fe922782516bd40ddd013ab38052450ed18a3ee1f8e23018f1b64b1a17724f33", "ja": "えへへ、ダンスはどんな風になるのかな？\n早くレッスンしたいな～♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，不知道舞蹈会是什么样的呢？\n真想快点开始练习啊～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_01_1027_016tsu", "source_sha256": "601251d5c6b4fb95551f6fd34e5dc04e025fa2df702d3e56070cc103954bf210", "ja": "ねえねえ{$P$}さん、\n全員ってことは、他の事務所の子達も歌うんですか？", "zh": "那个那个，{$P$}先生，\n既然是全员参加，那其他事务所的偶像们也会一起唱吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_01_1028_p", "source_sha256": "072de5a9a5667952daef3bc79e39f87a59bf445bd16387f88520cdf6baa53d9d", "ja": "ああ、そういうことだ。\n参加するアイドル達は、みんなこの曲を歌うんだよ。", "zh": "啊，就是这么回事。\n参加的偶像们都会唱这首歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_01_1029_014mir", "source_sha256": "f18b8defd9b644d0d650854fbedea1a7aa78aff120b95d4de3af66bb12da9c7b", "ja": "わあ、大合唱だ！　楽しみ～♪", "zh": "哇，大合唱！好期待～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_01_1030_016tsu", "source_sha256": "70fb5f0562b99fbc9f7c927b8f871e14db453928e1abee44161a9f103e3faa60", "ja": "じゃあ、ちょっとくらい失敗してもバレないですよね？\nえへへ、よかった♪", "zh": "那就算稍微出点差错，也不会被发现吧？\n嘿嘿，太好了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_01_1031_015siz", "source_sha256": "3b90e9d2de33c142b994a0da77b11fc2c26e356ff45183bb67225ad93d2ce5d6", "ja": "よくないわよ！　劇場の代表なんだから、\nしっかり歌わないと。未来もよ！", "zh": "好什么好啊！毕竟代表着剧场，\n必须好好唱才行。未来也是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_01_1032_014mir", "source_sha256": "5511451c2d99fbab1a24dc1f6bb01bc4999db469b6fc19c81a95b3d47325fbb3", "ja": "わ、ヒドイよ静香ちゃん！\n私は最初からしっかり頑張るつもりなのに～！", "zh": "哇，好过分啊静香！\n我本来就打算从一开始就好好加油的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_01_1033_016tsu", "source_sha256": "fdb5391674ade8db2f7f08eb3b78f89d3db09ac3ad4f2be9ec9d1cc13698181d", "ja": "わたしも、サボりたいなんて言ってないもーん♪\nライブは楽しみだし、楽しく頑張りまーす！", "zh": "我也没说想偷懒嘛～♪\n演唱会我很期待，会开开心心加油的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
